<h3><u>muslim ke shahzade</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Muslim ke shahzaade..(4)<br />
haye ibraheem, haye mohammad..(2)<br />
laal roqaiyya ke..(2)<br />
muslim ke shahzaade..(2)<br />
koofe mein ghir gaye hai..<br />
muslim ke shahzaade</p>

<p>Koi zara ye jaakar.. (2)<br />
koofe mein ghir gaye hai..muslim ke shahzaade.. (2)</p>

<p>1. Jaane de humko zalim, haris(l.a.) se bole bache<br />
firte hai maare maare, do din se bhuke pyaase<br />
sar kaatne se pehle..(2)<br />
paani hame pila de</p>

<p>koofe mein ghir gaye hai..muslim ke shahzaade.. (2)</p>

<p>2. Lagte the jab tamache, maa ko pukarte the<br />
hasta tha jab sitamgar, kehte the roke bache<br />
zalim hamari koi..(2)<br />
takseer to bata de<br />
koofe mein ghir gaye hai..muslim ke shahzaade.. (2)</p>

<p>3. Dil par asar hai itna, abbas ki wafa ka<br />
khwahish bade ki hai wo, qurbaan pehle hoga<br />
chota ye chahta hai..(2)<br />
wo pehle sar katade<br />
koofe mein ghir gaye hai..muslim ke shahzaade.. (2)</p>

<p>4. Jisko ameer muslim, sheh ne laqab diya tha<br />
aulaad par usi ki, aaya hai waqt kaisa<br />
jo chahe ghudkiya de..(2)<br />
jo chahe wo saza de<br />
koofe mein ghir gaye hai..muslim ke shahzaade.. (2)</p>

<p>5. Muslim ki thi wasiyat, do mere laadle hai<br />
aafat padi hai aisi, mujhse bichhad gaye hai<br />
mar jaau jab mai koi..(2)<br />
maa se unhe mila de</p>

<p>6. Dhundho yahi kahi&#39;n hai, unse bhi badla lunga<br />
hakim ye keh raha tha, in&#39;aam usko dunga<br />
ghaazi ke bhanjo ko..(2)<br />
jo qaid karke laade</p>

<p>7. Koofe ke darr pe jisdum, muslim ki laash dekhi<br />
akbar kaha ye maa ne, ro ro ke mere waali<br />
batla de bus kaha&#39;n hai..(2)<br />
aaqa kaneez zaade</p>

<p>haye ibraheem, haye mohammad..(2)</p>
